mRec}(A)\\)</span> (primitive-recursive predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}ackermann} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rec}(A)\n\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{PrimRec}(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}ackermann} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Rec}(A)\n\\land\n\\neg\\mathrm{PrimRec}(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>的递归方程由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a89fca2dc3b5b5cb\" href=\"?note=a89fca2dc3b5b5cb\" title=\"88-df-ackermann-function\">88-df-ackermann-function</a>唯一固定；本例只记录其分类性质。</li>\n<li>Ackermann函数是递归但非原始递归的经典例子</li>\n<li>Ackermann函数增长极快</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ackermann-function","status":"resolved","id":"a89fca2dc3b5b5cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ackermann-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"dc5cdd518dfec518","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"dc5cdd518dfec518","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","locatio